  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "m13-s001",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-a",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 5540,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "This is the go/no-go for the northern depots cutover. JJ, technical readiness first."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s002",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-d",
      "startMs": 5790,
      "endMs": 14370,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The timezone fix is in, the rerun was clean, and the duplicate depot codes are gone. From our side we're ready."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s003",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-c",
      "startMs": 14620,
      "endMs": 19020,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Same from integrations. The northern depot managers have been briefed."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s004",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-e",
      "startMs": 19270,
      "endMs": 25570,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "And legal approved the data processing addendum last week, so the contract side is closed."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s005",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-b",
      "startMs": 25820,
      "endMs": 30600,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "What's our rollback story if it goes wrong on the day?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s006",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-c",
      "startMs": 30850,
      "endMs": 38290,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "We can switch back to the old optimizer within an hour, but it isn't written down properly yet."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s007",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-b",
      "startMs": 38540,
      "endMs": 42560,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I want it written down before we flip anything."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s008",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-c",
      "startMs": 42810,
      "endMs": 46450,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'll write the rollback runbook by April 9."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s009",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-b",
      "startMs": 46700,
      "endMs": 49580,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Good. Then my view is go."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s010",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-a",
      "startMs": 49830,
      "endMs": 55370,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Anyone against? Then it's a go. Northern depots cut over on April 13."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s011",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-d",
      "startMs": 55620,
      "endMs": 62300,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "April 13 is a Monday, which is good, the weekend volumes are lower on Sunday night."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s012",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-b",
      "startMs": 62550,
      "endMs": 67710,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'll brief the board on the cutover plan at next week's meeting."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s013",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-a",
      "startMs": 67960,
      "endMs": 73120,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Thanks Marcus. Ravi, who do you report to for the runbook sign-off?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s014",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-c",
      "startMs": 73370,
      "endMs": 77390,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I report to Marcus, so he signs it off."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s015",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-b",
      "startMs": 77640,
      "endMs": 78620,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s016",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-a",
      "startMs": 78870,
      "endMs": 81370,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "JJ, anything else you need?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s017",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-d",
      "startMs": 81620,
      "endMs": 86780,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Just a freeze on changes to the carrier tables from April 10."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s018",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-e",
      "startMs": 87030,
      "endMs": 89910,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'll tell the carrier team today."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s019",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-a",
      "startMs": 90160,
      "endMs": 94180,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Great. Last thing, the team dinner after the cutover."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s020",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-e",
      "startMs": 94430,
      "endMs": 99590,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Please don't book the seafood place again. Marcus has a shellfish allergy."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s021",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-b",
      "startMs": 99840,
      "endMs": 103100,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Thank you, Sarah. Yes, a serious one."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s022",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-a",
      "startMs": 103350,
      "endMs": 106610,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Noted, no seafood. We'll find somewhere else."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s023",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-c",
      "startMs": 106860,
      "endMs": 110500,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The Italian place near the depot is good."
    },
    {
      "id": "m13-s024",
      "speakerId": "m13-spk-a",
      "startMs": 110750,
      "endMs": 116670,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Perfect. So: go for April 13, runbook by April 9, board briefing next week."
    }
  ],
  "note": {
    "version": 1,
    "body": "# Halden northern depots cutover go/no-go\n\n**Date:** April 2\n**Attendees:** Alex Rivera (Larkspur Labs), JJ (Larkspur Labs), Marcus Webb (Halden Freight), Ravi Menon (Halden Freight), Sarah Okonkwo (Halden Freight)\n\n## Summary\n\nGo/no-go review for the first regional cutover of the Halden route optimizer migration.\n\n## Readiness\n\n- **Technical:** the timezone fix is in, the rerun was clean, and the duplicate depot codes have been removed.\n- **Integrations:** northern depot managers have been briefed.\n- **Contract:** legal approved the data processing addendum last week.\n- **Rollback:** the old optimizer can be restored within an hour, but the procedure is not yet written down. Marcus wants it documented before anything is switched.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- **Go.** The northern depots cut over on **April 13**.\n- Changes to the carrier tables are frozen from April 10.\n\n## Action items\n\n- **Ravi Menon** — write the rollback runbook by April 9. Ravi reports to Marcus, who signs it off.\n- **Marcus Webb** — brief the board on the cutover plan at next week's board meeting.\n- **Sarah Okonkwo** — tell the carrier team about the change freeze today.\n\n## Notes\n\n- For the post-cutover team dinner, avoid seafood restaurants. Ravi suggested the Italian place near the depot instead, and Alex will book it once the cutover date holds.\n"
  },
